socmint/data/underground_channels.json
--------------------------------------
Derived from deepdarkCTI — a collection of Cyber Threat Intelligence sources
from the Deep and Dark Web.

  Source:  https://github.com/fastfire/deepdarkCTI
  Author:  fastfire and deepdarkCTI contributors
  License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)

Only the public Telegram channel identifiers (username, status, category and
label) were extracted from the project's Telegram source lists. Invite-only
("t.me/+…") and offline/expired/seized entries were removed, because this tool
reads public channels only and never joins. No other deepdarkCTI content is
included. The data is used as reference (a starting list of channels to search);
every post the tool keeps comes from a live, date-bounded search with the
platform's own timestamp.

